			],
			"Message": "docs(Deps): Standardize funding section with HTML table and acknowledgements\n\nReplace the three raw markdown funding tables in Maintain/README.md and both Maintain/Cache/Include README files with identical HTML tables that include labeled headers, consistent image sizing, and a new introductory blurb expressing gratitude to supporters.\n\nAlso rename the section heading from \"Funding\" to \"Funding & Acknowledgements\" with a 🙏🏻 emoji across all three locations, and add a brief Land-branded preamble paragraph noting the NGI0 Commons Fund and NLnet support.\n\nThis brings visual consistency to the funding section across the Documentation subsystem and presents a more polished, thank-you-first tone to visitors.",
			"SHA": "1b77736ee7a6195142495e343f090026dc95cc62"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-07-08T16:08:17Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				175,
				3
			],
			"Message": "chore(Deps): Add git hooks and refresh README structure\n\nAdd post-checkout and post-merge githooks that automatically run `git submodule update --init --remote --recursive --merge`, eliminating the common failure mode where contributors forget to update nested submodules after switching branches or pulling.\n\nRefresh the README landing section to include the Land 🏞️ emoji, condense link blocks to single lines, replace the plain-text funding section with an HTML table matching the badge-grid visual style used elsewhere, and drop the outdated step-by-step build guide (the cross-repo link was already broken).\n\nNo functional change to the Dependency tree itself — only developer experience and documentation surface improvements.",
			"SHA": "15a9cbec0b63f9103eede5d57561bd78c0ea87bd"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T18:48:58Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
