				1
			],
			"Message": "fix: Point Tauri submodule to cleaned tree",
			"SHA": "0d7a9034395fec753d8ac7f0122920db386aacda"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T01:59:06Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				172,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Deps): Simplify README badge grid to reflect cleaned submodule tree\n\nReplace the verbose per-repository badge matrix (Echo, Element, River, Sun, OXC, Biome, etc.) with a compact overview listing only the repositories that remain after the Dependency cleanup: Microsoft, SWC, and Tauri.\n\nThe old table enumerated every submodule individually including stale entries for Biome, OXC, Rolldown, and Vercel that were removed in prior commits. The new layout consolidates Tauri into a single entry (no longer split into Cargo/NPM/Service sub-tables) and drops the redundant duplicate Land row.\n\nAlso fix the broken build-instructions link from an empty `()` to a valid relative path `../Documentation/GitHub/Building.md`.",
			"SHA": "2e15a177eebd873b6bea7614b64aaeda1d184b72"
		},
